// ==============================================================================
// File: tests/test2_precedence.toy
// Purpose: Test operator precedence and parenthetical expression grouping.
//
// What it Tests:
//  - Verifies that multiplication takes precedence over addition:
//    '2 + 3 * 4' parses as '2 + (3 * 4)' instead of '(2 + 3) * 4'.
//  - Verifies that parentheses override precedence:
//    '(2 + 3) * 4' parses the addition subtree first.
//  - Validates that AST hierarchy and TAC execution order strictly follow PEMDAS.
// ==============================================================================

a = 2 + 3 * 4;
b = (2 + 3) * 4;
print(a);
print(b);
